        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5059US19CCUS4KNKUS19, Black and Brass Conical Knurled Knob with Disk Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Black and Gold Knurled Knob is a stunning and modern knob specifically designed to look hot. This Black and Brass Conical Knurled Knob with Disk Rose is easy to install and will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It has a two-toned finish pairing of satin brass and matte black for a stunning end product that is modern. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-CC-speecifications.gif?v=1704354555\" width=\"519\" height=\"297\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Conical Knob Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Emtek Select Disk Rose with Knurled Conical Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Two-Tone Knurled Conical Knobset with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Rose Finish: Matte Black</li>\r\n<li>Stem Finish: Satin Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Finish: Matte Black</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-cc-Specification.pdf?v=1704262419\"><b>Emtek Select Conical Knob Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This mix-match style knob is totally customizable. If you need a different finish combination or a different rose style, <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</b></a>\r\n</p>",
